		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_592942834747791479">
		Gravelly disappointed, usage of AI	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_592942834747791479">
		I was so looking forward to buy this game when I saw the devs used LLMs to translate the game. Why did you have to go do that? It was easy not to.	</div>
		
	<div class="forum_op_footer">
		<div></div>
			</div>
</div>
<div data-featuretarget="community-awards"></div>
<script type="text/javascript">
	$J( function() {
		InitializeForumTopic( {"owner":"44982085","type":"General","feature":"0","gidforum":"4358997660741168049","forum_display_name":"General Discussions","forum_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/2934330\/discussions\/0\/","forum_search_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/2934330\/discussions\/search\/","is_public":1,"permissions":{"can_view":1,"can_post":1,"can_reply":1,"is_banned":0,"can_delete":0,"can_edit":0},"appid":2934330}, "https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/forum\/44982085\/General\/",
		"592942834747791479", {"author":"Overworked Screeching Piglet","text":"I was so looking forward to buy this game when I saw the devs used LLMs to translate the game. Why did you have to go do that? It was easy not to."}		);
			} );
</script>
										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791474503493_4358997660741168049_592942834747791479", {"feature":"4358997660741168049","feature2":"592942834747791479","owner":"103582791474503493","commentthreadid":"656625952","total_count":42,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":80849580,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":2934330,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"592942834747792096":{"text":"Yeah, I was really excited for the game but not going to be buying it now. Sorry but I have my principles. Please hire a translator or don't do it otherwise","author":"Deware"},"592942834747792173":{"text":"Bro will never release anything of value ever in his life, and he's out here complaining because the developer uses something that Google Translate has been using for over a decade.","author":"KAPEEP"},"592942834747793676":{"text":"Putting it through Google translate would make you feel better?","author":"uhhhh"},"592942834747794160":{"text":"There's nothing wrong with using AI to translate language","author":"Elmocreed"},"592942834747794399":{"text":"there's a difference between regular ai (helps automate tasks, does mundane tasks by itself, translations etc) and generative ai (\"\"\"makes\"\"\" things like artwork, 3d models, textures, voice lines, dialogue, etc)","author":"CasioPSX"},"592942834747794515":{"text":"\"Gravely\"....Drama queen much? Of all the things to be upset about AI wise, translation is not one of them.","author":"AJM76_"},"592942834747795861":{"text":"\"Gravely\" is a bit heavy, but same here. Just got the email that it was released since it was on my wishlist, but that's an automatic no. Quick glance at the developer's X suggests there's other undisclosed usage as well.","author":"D6"},"592942834747796022":{"text":"Toddlers.","author":"impactos_enredos0i"},"592942834747796894":{"text":"I'm happy they've used AI; I've seen hundreds of poorly done translations by so-called professionals.","author":"Leaffar"},"592942834747799455":{"text":"Machine translation isn't a new thing","author":"AcousticHITMAN45"},"592942834747799866":{"text":"bro get the fuck out with your bs. if this game made with style and have soul most people dgaf on your AI witch hunt posts. Go touch some grass","author":"Headshot"},"592942834747799923":{"text":"lots of game devs have done worse. that said, if sales are good, they should hire editors to ensure quality in all supported lanfuages.","author":"warpspeedscp"},"592942834747803018":{"text":"This is worrying me. Is there a lot of text in the game, or is it just menus and occasional reading?\n\nHonestly, I\u2019m not willing to constantly read text while playing (given that voice-generation technology exists) just because the same people who demonized motor vehicles 150 years ago have reared their heads again.","author":"Pecero"},"592942834747811108":{"text":"[quote=Pecero;592942834747803018]This is worrying me. Is there a lot of text in the game, or is it just menus and occasional reading?\n\nHonestly, I\u2019m not willing to constantly read text while playing (given that voice-generation technology exists) just because the same people who demonized motor vehicles 150 years ago have reared their heads again. [\/quote]\n\n\nI'm not sure if there is a lot, but the few I've seen so far in the translated language is of poor quality.","author":"Overworked Screeching Piglet"},"592942834747835425":{"text":"If you've ever once in your life used something to translate a message or a website for you , then you're guilty of this same exact crime","author":"Foxador"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
<div class="commentthread_area forumtopic_comments" id="commentthread_ForumTopic_103582791474503493_4358997660741168049_592942834747791479_area">
	        <div id="commentthread_ForumTopic_103582791474503493_4358997660741168049_592942834747791479_pagectn" class="forum_paging" style="">
            <div class="forum_paging_controls" id="commentthread_ForumTopic_103582791474503493_4358997660741168049_592942834747791479_pagecontrols">
                <a href="javascript:void(0);" id="commentthread_ForumTopic_103582791474503493_4358997660741168049_592942834747791479_pagebtn_prev" class="pagebtn">&lt;</a>
                <span id="commentthread_ForumTopic_103582791474503493_4358997660741168049_592942834747791479_pagelinks" class="commentthread_pagelinks"></span>
                <span id="commentthread_ForumTopic_103582791474503493_4358997660741168049_592942834747791479_pagedropdown" class="commentthread_pagedropdown"></span>
                <a href="javascript:void(0);" id="commentthread_ForumTopic_103582791474503493_4358997660741168049_592942834747791479_pagebtn_next" class="pagebtn">&gt;</a>
